.TH HTTP_CHUNK_END 3
.SH NAME
http_chunk_end \- end the chunked body
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B #include <http.h>
.P
.BI "int http_chunk_end(http* " h ");"
.SH DESCRIPTION

.BR http_chunk_end ()
queues the last chunk, which ends the body.
.SH RETURN VALUE
1 on success, 0 on failure.
.SH SEE ALSO
http_chunk(3)
